        <h2 id="overview-en">What is the MPSC Gazetted Civil Services Exam?</h2>
        <p>
          <strong>MPSC Gazetted Civil Services (State Services / Rajyaseva)</strong> is the premier administrative examination conducted to recruit Class A (Group A) and Class B (Group B) officers for the Maharashtra State Government. Through this examination, direct appointments are made to prestigious posts such as Deputy Collector, Deputy Superintendent of Police (DySP), and Tehsildar.
        </p>

        <!-- Key Information Grid -->
        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-3 gap-4 my-6">
          <div class="bg-bg-surface border border-border-card p-4 rounded-xl flex items-start gap-3">
            <HiOutlineBuildingOffice className="text-primary text-2xl shrink-0 mt-0.5" />
